; Copy this to  C:\FingerUnlock\service.ini
; Phase 3: shared-secret token + the paired phone's Expo push token.

port=5599
; Long random secret; the phone sends this on /approve.
token=change-this-to-a-long-random-secret
; The phone's Expo push token (ExponentPushToken[...]). Filled automatically when
; the phone pairs (POST /register), or paste it here manually.
pushtoken=
